                           |GKBJUDGEMENT OF THE MIND
|YK0================================================================

|YKB'He who merely knows right principles is not equal to him who
loves them.'|WKO - |RKBSage Confucius|WKO

|YKOA Monk can determine the mental state of a friend or foe by
taking a few seconds to relax their spirit and reach out with
their emotions. It can be useful in determining what course
should be taken with those not as disciplined as the Monk.

|BK0This is a Master of the East Wind power.

